casebook d-30cfr-75_1103-5-mine-co-warning-draft v1
source "D-30cfr-75.1103-5-mine-co-warning.txt" dated 2026-10-14 by "drafted by anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5 from the manual; not yet approved"
note "UNAPPROVED DRAFT: written by a language model from D-30cfr-75.1103-5-mine-co-warning.txt. Every declaration below cites the sentence"
note "it came from. Check each against the manual, add what the manual does not say, then delete"
note "this note to approve. quorum studio will not build a chip image while it is here."

# manual: "When the carbon monoxide level reaches 10 parts per million above the established ambient level at any sensor location"
observe co_high "carbon monoxide is 10 ppm above the established ambient level at a sensor location"

# manual: "If any sensor indicates a warning"
observe sensor_warning "a sensor indicates a warning"

# manual: "unless the mine operator determines that the signal does not present a hazard to miners"
observe operator_no_hazard "the mine operator has determined the signal does not present a hazard to miners"

# manual: "If any fire detection component becomes inoperative"
observe detector_inoperative "a fire detection component has become inoperative"

# manual: "after the belt is stopped"
observe belt_stopped "the belt has been stopped"

# manual: "an examination for hot rollers and fire is made"
observe hot_roller_exam_made "an examination for hot rollers and fire has been made"

# manual: "When a malfunction or warning signal is received at the manned surface location"
observe signal_received_surface "a malfunction or warning signal is received at the manned surface location"

# manual: "Upon notification of a malfunction or warning signal"
observe signal_notification_made "personnel have been notified of a malfunction or warning signal"

# manual: "If the warning signal will be activated during calibration of sensors"
observe calibrating "calibration of sensors is in progress and the warning signal will be activated"

# manual: "If one sensor becomes inoperative"
observe one_sensor_inoperative "one fire sensor has become inoperative"

# manual: "If two or more adjacent sensors become inoperative"
observe adjacent_sensors_inoperative "two or more adjacent fire sensors have become inoperative"

# manual: "If the complete fire detection system becomes inoperative"
observe complete_system_inoperative "the complete fire detection system has become inoperative"

# manual: "any concentration of carbon monoxide that reaches 10 parts per million above the established ambient level"
observe monitor_detects_co_high "a trained person monitoring finds carbon monoxide 10 ppm above the established ambient level"

# manual: "unless the mine operator knows that the source of the carbon monoxide does not present a hazard to miners"
observe operator_knows_source_safe "the mine operator knows the source of the carbon monoxide is not a hazard to miners"

# manual: "If any sensor indicates a warning, the following actions must be taken"
claim fire_hazard "a sensor warning indicates a possible fire hazard to miners" severity 9 needs sensor_warning

# manual: "immediate action must be taken to repair the component"
claim detector_fault "fire detection component inoperative and needs repair" severity 4 needs detector_inoperative

# manual: "unless the mine operator determines that the signal does not present a hazard to miners"
excuse operator_clears "operator determined the signal is not a hazard" needs operator_no_hazard

# manual: "When the carbon monoxide level reaches 10 parts per million above the established ambient level at any sensor location, automatic fire sensor and warning device systems shall provide an effective warning signal at the following locations"
claim co_warning "carbon monoxide level requires a warning signal" severity 5 needs co_high

# manual: "shall be monitored for a period of 4 hours after the belt is stopped"
claim post_stop_monitoring_required "the fire sensor and warning system must be monitored for 4 hours after the belt is stopped" severity 3 needs belt_stopped

# manual: "unless an examination for hot rollers and fire is made as prescribed in § 75"
excuse exam_made "an examination for hot rollers and fire was made, so the 4-hour monitoring is not required" needs hot_roller_exam_made

# manual: "the sensors that are activated must be identified and appropriate personnel immediately notified"
claim notification_due "a received malfunction or warning signal requires the activated sensors to be identified and personnel notified" severity 5 needs signal_received_surface

# manual: "appropriate personnel must immediately initiate an investigation to determine the cause of the malfunction or warning signal"
claim investigation_due "a notified malfunction or warning signal requires an immediate investigation into its cause" severity 5 needs signal_notification_made

# manual: "personnel manning the surface location must be notified prior to and upon completion of calibration"
claim calibration_notice_due "personnel manning the surface location must be notified prior to and upon completion of calibration" severity 3 needs calibrating

# manual: "Affected working sections, areas where mechanized mining equipment is being installed or removed, or other areas designated in the approved emergency evacuation and firefighting program of instruction must be notified at the beginning and completion of calibration."
claim calibration_area_notice_due "affected working sections and designated areas must be notified at the beginning and completion of calibration" severity 3 needs calibrating

# manual: "a trained person must continuously monitor for carbon monoxide at the inoperative sensor"
claim single_sensor_monitoring_due "a trained person must continuously monitor for carbon monoxide at the inoperative sensor" severity 4 needs one_sensor_inoperative

# manual: "trained persons must patrol and continuously monitor the affected areas for carbon monoxide so that they will be traveled each hour in their entirety"
claim adjacent_sensor_patrol_due "trained persons must patrol and continuously monitor the affected areas so they are traveled each hour in their entirety" severity 4 needs adjacent_sensors_inoperative

# manual: "trained persons must patrol and continuously monitor the affected areas for carbon monoxide so that they will be traveled each hour in their entirety"
claim complete_system_patrol_due "with the whole system down, trained persons must patrol and monitor the affected areas each hour in their entirety" severity 4 needs complete_system_inoperative

# manual: "Trained persons who conduct monitoring under this section must immediately report to the surface any concentration of carbon monoxide that reaches 10 parts per million above the established ambient level"
claim monitor_report_due "monitoring personnel must immediately report the carbon monoxide concentration to the surface" severity 5 needs monitor_detects_co_high

# manual: "unless the mine operator knows that the source of the carbon monoxide does not present a hazard to miners"
excuse source_known_safe "operator knows the carbon monoxide source is not hazardous, so no report is required" needs operator_knows_source_safe

# manual: "unless the mine operator determines that the signal does not present a hazard to miners"
operator_clears undercuts fire_hazard

# manual: "unless an examination for hot rollers and fire is made as prescribed in § 75"
exam_made undercuts post_stop_monitoring_required

# manual: "unless the mine operator knows that the source of the carbon monoxide does not present a hazard to miners"
source_known_safe undercuts monitor_report_due

# manual: "All miners in the affected areas, unless assigned emergency response duties, must be immediately withdrawn to a safe location identified in the mine emergency evacuation and firefighting program of instruction."
action withdraw_miners safe when any fire_hazard

# manual: "immediate action must be taken to repair the component"
action repair_and_monitor when any detector_fault

# manual: "automatic fire sensor and warning device systems shall provide an effective warning signal at the following locations"
action raise_alarm when any co_warning

# manual: "operation of the belt may continue if the following requirements are met"
action keep_running idle

# manual: "The automatic fire sensor and warning device system shall be monitored for a period of 4 hours after the belt is stopped"
action monitor_system when any post_stop_monitoring_required

# manual: "the sensors that are activated must be identified and appropriate personnel immediately notified"
action notify_personnel when any notification_due

# manual: "appropriate personnel must immediately initiate an investigation to determine the cause of the malfunction or warning signal"
action investigate_signal when any investigation_due

# manual: "Appropriate personnel must notify miners in affected working sections, in affected areas where mechanized mining equipment is being installed or removed, and at other locations specified in the approved mine emergency evacuation and firefighting program of instruction"
action notify_miners when any fire_hazard

# manual: "personnel manning the surface location must be notified prior to and upon completion of calibration"
action notify_surface_calibration when any calibration_notice_due

# manual: "Affected working sections, areas where mechanized mining equipment is being installed or removed, or other areas designated in the approved emergency evacuation and firefighting program of instruction must be notified at the beginning and completion of calibration."
action notify_calibration_areas when any calibration_area_notice_due

# manual: "a trained person must continuously monitor for carbon monoxide at the inoperative sensor"
action monitor_inoperative_sensor when any single_sensor_monitoring_due

# manual: "trained persons must patrol and continuously monitor the affected areas for carbon monoxide so that they will be traveled each hour in their entirety"
action patrol_affected_areas when any adjacent_sensor_patrol_due

# manual: "trained persons must patrol and continuously monitor the affected areas for carbon monoxide so that they will be traveled each hour in their entirety"
action patrol_complete_system when any complete_system_patrol_due

# manual: "Alternatively, a trained person must be stationed at each inoperative sensor to monitor for carbon monoxide"
action station_trained_person when any adjacent_sensor_patrol_due

# manual: "must immediately report to the surface any concentration of carbon monoxide that reaches 10 parts per million above the established ambient level"
action report_co_to_surface when any monitor_report_due

# manual: "trained persons must patrol and continuously monitor the affected areas for carbon monoxide so that they will be traveled each hour in their entirety"
prefer withdraw_miners over notify_miners over repair_and_monitor over monitor_inoperative_sensor over patrol_affected_areas over station_trained_person over patrol_complete_system over report_co_to_surface over raise_alarm over notify_personnel over notify_surface_calibration over notify_calibration_areas over investigate_signal over monitor_system over keep_running
